// ============================================================================
//  mod_magmagat.zone  -  THE MAGMAGAT AND MAGMUS OPERANDI, ON EVERY MAP (2026-10-07)
//
//  Port of luckass's MagmaGat (the Black Ops 4 Mob of the Dead remaster weapon,
//  github lborruto/t6_motd_magmagat v1.0.5, MIT) into zm_qol, fourteenth gun in,
//  following mod_blundergat.zone line for line. The art comes from this mod's own
//  carve of his built fastfile: zone_source\magmagat_donor\mod.ff, --load'ed LAST
//  in build_ff.bat, so every name below that the donor carries resolves there and
//  every stock name below resolves from the zombies fastfiles above it.
//
//  SOURCE NOTES, all verified against the Unlinker dump of his 1.0.5 mod.ff:
//    - The gun is the Acid Gat mechanism with fire: both forms fire a harmless
//      shot (shotCount 1, no tracer, impactType none) and the script lobs the
//      blob with magicgrenadetype("mg_magma_blob_zm", ...) - there is no
//      magicGrenadeType field in either def. mg_weapon.gsc does the rest.
//    - The three custom view anims (mg_viewmodel_magmagat_reload, _reload_empty,
//      _first_raise) are copies of the Blundergat's own with the notetracks
//      rewritten to BO4's foley (mg_reload_open/insert/close, mg_raise_cock).
//      Everything else stays the Blundergat's, declared below.
//    - The muzzle flashes are his fire-coloured copies of the Acid Gat's under
//      his mg/ namespace, NOT the stock weapon/blundersplat ones.
//    - The blob def is stock zm_prison's blundersplat_explosive_dart_zm with the
//      model, trail, damage and explosion stripped (all of that is scripted); it
//      keeps the dart's german-grenade view anims, declared below. Nobody holds
//      it, so they are def validity only.
//
//  🛑 THE WEAPON DEFS ARE NOT DECLARED HERE, same rule as every other ported
//  gun: they ship raw in weapons\zm\ - magmagat_zm 19,829 B,
//  magmagat_upgraded_zm 19,878 B, mg_magma_blob_zm 20,371 B, all under the
//  20,480-byte runtime-loader ceiling with no trims needed.
//
//  📝 CAMO. His mod recolours with the stock camo_870mcs table, whose slots 3
//  and 12 do not map a MagmaGat material on our model set; zm_qol's own
//  camo_qol_magmagat (zone_assets\camo\, built from the blundergat/gallo
//  pattern) maps every model material except the two BO4 armour-kit materials,
//  which the Blundergat precedent leaves uncamo'd too. Both gun defs name it;
//  the blob is an offhand projectile nobody holds and keeps the dart's empty
//  camo field.
// ============================================================================

// the two BO4 gun pairs and the blob model; the far LODs, the lava-tank material
// and the _pap PaP materials ride along as the xmodels' own dependencies
xmodel,mg_magmagat_view
xmodel,mg_magmagat_world
xmodel,mg_magmus_view
xmodel,mg_magmus_world
xmodel,mg_magma_blob

// both defs' muzzle flashes and every effect the weapon script loadfx's by name
// (mg_fx_init in scripts\zm\magmagat.gsc; the burn/blob_fire/burst_fire paths are
// zm_prison/zm_transit stock paths, resolvable from the --load list)
fx,mg/fx_blundersplat_muzzleflash
fx,mg/fx_blundersplat_muzzleflash_3p
fx,mg/fx_blundersplat_muzzleflash_ug
fx,mg/fx_blundersplat_muzzleflash_ug_3p
fx,mg/fx_magmagat_trail_bolt
fx,mg/fx_magmagat_impact
fx,mg/fx_magmagat_explode
fx,mg/fx_prison_magmagat_aoe

// zm_qol's own PaP camo table for the gun (both defs)
camo,camo_qol_magmagat

// the three BO4-foley anims, out of the donor
xanim,mg_viewmodel_magmagat_first_raise
xanim,mg_viewmodel_magmagat_reload
xanim,mg_viewmodel_magmagat_reload_empty

